abstract: "One evolving, explicitly incomplete Spanish edition of SGA. This successor reconciles SGA 5 into distinct corrected/current and diplomatic/original branches; retains the complete SGA 1, SGA 2, and SGA 6 readers; and preserves the complete corrected/current and diplomatic/original SGA 7 Tome I readers as standalone assets."
